//! # {{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-infrastructure
//!
//! Infrastructure layer for {{project.name}}.
//! Implements port traits defined in the application crate.
//!
//! ## Design Rules
//!
//! - Depends on both domain and application crates.
//! - Implements port traits from the application layer.
//! - Owns all external I/O: database, filesystem, network, settings.
//! - SQLite via rusqlite with WAL mode for local-first persistence.
//!
//! ## Module Structure
//!
//! ```text
//! src/
//! ├── database/       ← SQLite persistence, migrations, repositories
//! ├── filesystem/     ← File I/O operations
//! ├── settings.rs     ← App settings / preferences
//! ├── logging.rs      ← Tracing subscriber setup
//! ├── errors.rs       ← Infrastructure error types
//! └── lib.rs          ← Public API
//! ```

pub mod database;
pub mod errors;
pub mod filesystem;
pub mod logging;
pub mod settings;
